# Legacy base

Read `.cursor/knowledge/legacy-base/architecture.md` before treating a commons class as this trámite's behavior.

The module `pom.xml` artifact selects the commons tree. Do not describe a method from a different tree. Parent method bodies stay in that architecture file. A process knowledge base records only overrides.
